WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,240
I really didn’t bring any meat back to the car.

2
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:03,280
But he made it clear

3
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:05,240
If you want to get resources from now on, just go work

4
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:06,640
And the next step is to build a house

5
00:00:06,640 --> 00:00:07,640
Requires a lot of manpower

6
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:09,480
At least do as much as he can

7
00:00:09,480 --> 00:00:10,880
Tell me how much you want first

8
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:14,120
Work for a man for half a day and eat a meal

9
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:15,480
I bought you off

10
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:17,680
You guys are so cheap

11
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:19,240
Let’s not even talk about whether it’s cheap or not.

12
00:00:19,240 --> 00:00:20,760
at least i'm full

13
00:00:20,760 --> 00:00:22,360
You're quite noble here

14
00:00:22,360 --> 00:00:26,790
So noble that I don’t know where I am at dinner, I just know

15
00:00:26,790 --> 00:00:28,070
How much did I do today

16
00:00:28,070 --> 00:00:29,110
How much did you eat

17
00:00:29,190 --> 00:00:30,910
No one has any snacks but give me one

18
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:37,110
Not enough

19
00:00:37,110 --> 00:00:38,350
It's not a firewood problem

20
00:00:38,350 --> 00:00:39,350
The fire is too weak

21
00:00:39,350 --> 00:00:40,310
Destroy again

22
00:00:40,310 --> 00:00:42,230
I have to check my blood pressure again tonight

23
00:00:42,230 --> 00:00:43,470
It's okay if you want to catch the fire

24
00:00:43,470 --> 00:00:45,110
Install two sets of sea water for me tomorrow

25
00:00:45,110 --> 00:00:46,470
We have been tired all day today

26
00:00:46,470 --> 00:00:48,150
The fire is not limited to Sister Fei

27
00:00:48,150 --> 00:00:49,110
you mean

28
00:00:49,110 --> 00:00:51,510
You need to borrow the car from him

29
00:00:51,510 --> 00:00:52,550
He won't show it

30
00:00:52,550 --> 00:00:54,470
So I'm going to talk about it

31
00:00:54,470 --> 00:00:55,470
I'd like to see it

32
00:00:55,470 --> 00:00:57,030
Can I use the car to set you up?

33
00:00:57,030 --> 00:00:58,630
Don't wait and be chased back again later

34
00:00:58,630 --> 00:01:00,390
And you have to beg me to order turkey turkey.

35
00:01:00,390 --> 00:01:01,590
At least before I went

36
00:01:01,590 --> 00:01:02,790
You know you have to pay the price

37
00:01:02,830 --> 00:01:03,990
unlike some people

38
00:01:03,990 --> 00:01:05,470
Let’s talk about the all-female family first.

39
00:01:05,470 --> 00:01:06,870
I'll use everything later to jam myself.
